{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05966","headline":"酬虞部苏员外过蓝田别业不见留之作 · 王维","name":"酬虞部苏员外过蓝田别业不见留之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫居依谷口，乔木带荒村。\n石路枉廻驾，山家谁候门。\n渔舟胶冻浦，猎火烧寒原。\n唯有白云外，疎钟闻夜猿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}